      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Howard Melvin Fast (November 11, 1914 – March 12, 2003) was an American novelist and television writer. Fast also wrote under the pen names E. V. Cunningham and Walter Ericson.",
