    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Lloyd \"Skip\" Shearer (December 20, 1916 – May 27, 2001) was a celebrity gossip columnist. From 1958 to 1991, he wrote \"Walter Scott's Personality Parade\" in \"Parade\" magazine. In this column he used the name Walter Scott, and discussed rumors about celebrities using a question-and-answer style. Shearer also wrote profiles of famous people under his real name.",
      "depth": 0,
